{{Unobtainable}}
'''Blue Shinobi''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that could be obtained by playing the [[Lunar New Year (Event Gacha)|Lunar New Year]] Event Gacha prior to [[Version 15.1 Update|Version 15.1]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update|Version 2.2]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it can be obtained by clearing [[Greece (Empire of Cats)|Greece]] and [[Russia (Empire of Cats)|Russia]] from the [[Empire of Cats]] chapter ten times each.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 82
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Blue Shinobi
|name2 = Orange Shinobi
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Orange Shinobi''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Blue Shinobi shines best at the [[Empire of Cats]] chapter and can play a key role in clearing through stages if unlocked early. What is unique about this unit compared to most clones is that there is no compromise when using this unit, in fact, it has marginally better stats than [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Ninja Cat]] and can be safely used in tandem to create a strong force upon the early-game. Just like Ninja Cat's normal and evolved forms, it becomes an obsolete unit when entering later sagas like [[Into the Future]] or the [[Legend Stages/SoL|Stories of Legends]] thus the usage drops tremendously overall. It does not even have additional uses outside of being a meatshield such as [[Talents]] to improve its stats/vary its usage or [[Cat Combo|Cat Combos]] to at least make it a possible Combo Slave.

While Blue Shinobi has limited service in the mobile version, the Nintendo Switch version is much easier to tackle and allows it to be more useful due to enemies in the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]] already nerfed as the enemies are given post stats from anti-alien treasures or balanced to be easier. Since this unit can be unlocked the moment Greece and Russia become unlocked in the Empire of Cats chapter, it can easily replace [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]] and work in tandem with Ninja Cat. Since The Battle Cats Unite! is in a early-mid SOL meta, there can be some instances in which there are stages that Ninja Cat is a fine choice which also applies to Blue Shinobi.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

