==Trivia==
*Blue Shinobi is an obvious reference to [[wikia:ninjahattori:Kanzo Hattori|Kanzo Hattori]] of ''Ninja Hattori-kun'', while Orange Shinobi's cheeks and color scheme are changed to match [[wikia:ninjahattori:Shinzo Hattori|Shinzo Hattori]].
*Blue Shinobi was formerly unlocked by inputting a [[Serial Codes|Serial Code]] from the [[Merchandise#Nyanko Great War! Strap Set|Nyanko Great War! Strap Set]] until the feature was removed in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]].
*Blue Shinobi is among the units that were given multi-hit in [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]].
*Prior to [[Version 14.0 Update|Version 14.0]], Blue Shinobi's sprite in the Cat Storage appeared slightly vertically stretched.

